Description: Weather, tides, the sun, the moon, and maps drawn for the terminal
 Linecast brings weather forecasts, radar animations, solar arcs, lunar phases
 with multiple cultural calendars, night sky views, tide tables, and street
 or terrain maps directly into modern terminal emulators.
 .
 Built with braille dots, block glyphs, and 24-bit true color, linecast draws
 rich terminal visualisations with zero runtime C or external Python
 dependencies on Linux.
